  "texts": {
    "briefing": "Welcome to the world championships football!\n\nThe objective of this mission is that you push\nthe balls into the opponents goal. The player\nwho pushes in most balls wins.\n\nIt is required that you play this game in god\nmode, start the game with:\n\ntank -god -loadsofweapons\n\nYou have got to keep the score yourself."
  },
